      "updated": 1795621586000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The idempotent producer does NOT fix this: after a restart it is a NEW session and a new send(), so Kafka sees a distinct record, not a retry\n(more in note 4).",
      "originalText": "The idempotent producer does NOT fix this: after a restart it is a NEW session and a new send(), so Kafka sees a distinct record, not a retry (more in note 4).",
