      "text": "Rule: transactional.id must be unique per logical producer instance whose twin must never run concurrently. A transactional producer is\nautomatically idempotent.",
      "originalText": "Rule: transactional.id must be unique per logical producer instance whose twin must never run concurrently. A transactional producer is automatically idempotent.",
