      "text": "__transaction_state  (internal topic)\n\n- compacted\n- 50 partitions by default\n- replication factor 3\n- min.insync.replicas = 2 (standard configs)\n- holds the state of every transaction",
      "originalText": "__transaction_state  (internal topic)\n\n- compacted\n- 50 partitions by default\n- replication factor 3\n- min.insync.replicas = 2 (standard configs)\n- holds the state of every transaction",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "el00264",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "c04J"
    },
