      "updated": 1795621586000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "v1 fence: a partition always maps to the same id, so the new owner fences the old owner via the EPOCH.",
      "originalText": "v1 fence: a partition always maps to the same id, so the new owner fences the old owner via the EPOCH.",
