      "updated": 1795621586000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "EventPulse client: @confluentinc/kafka-javascript (librdkafka-based)\nlibrdkafka layer: init_transactions, begin_transaction, send_offsets_to_transaction, commit_transaction, abort_transaction\nKafkaJS-style API: producer.transaction() with send and sendOffsets, then commit() or abort()\nExact method names and EOS v2 group metadata are client-version specific: read the docs first.\nThe EventPulse sink calls NONE of this.",
      "originalText": "EventPulse client: @confluentinc/kafka-javascript (librdkafka-based)\nlibrdkafka layer: init_transactions, begin_transaction, send_offsets_to_transaction, commit_transaction, abort_transaction\nKafkaJS-style API: producer.transaction() with send and sendOffsets, then commit() or abort()\nExact method names and EOS v2 group metadata are client-version specific: read the docs first.\nThe EventPulse sink calls NONE of this.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "el00962",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "c0FZ"
