      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Heuristic: if the last box is not Kafka, transactions protect only the MIDDLE of the pipeline and the last hop still needs\nidempotence. Since you need that anyway, ask whether the transaction adds anything.",
      "originalText": "Heuristic: if the last box is not Kafka, transactions protect only the MIDDLE of the pipeline and the last hop still needs idempotence. Since you need that anyway, ask whether the transaction adds anything.",
